          "scope": "U* bus pin excursion above its supply during a mis-ordered mate",
          "because": "neither datasheet states how far a bus pin may stand above its own unpowered rail while the internal clamp carries the host's pull-up current; only a bench measurement of a mis-ordered mate closes it",
